e two untested filters need tests before approval. Record Architecture, Security and Simplification.","body":{"branch":"request/dated-active-cause-v2","conditions":"Review exact head 14194f3159f02055349760e1c5871d5e42cc41a1 and artifacts da0c333e (internal/workroom), 3c2a9157 (cmd/gs), ace86a21 (docs), cb5f6738 (SKILL.md), 3974113d (ui), 53f4e8c6 (internal/app) under planner's 2906cb7e. Verify by mutation that restoring the staleness() break fails TestWorldDateIsTheEarliestCauseWhicheverOrderTheBasesAreCitedIn by name, that counting self-retired supersessions fails TestWithdrawingOneRetirementLeavesTheDateOfTheOneThatRemains by name, and that reverting the guard fails both consumer tests by name. Judge whether activeRetirements' exclusion of self-retired supersessions matches the fold's cascading retirementCauses semantics. Confirm no second copy of the world-staleness rule exists in cmd/gs, that both consumers fail closed on a zero date, and that SKILL.md, docs/reference/gs/merge.md and docs/reference/architecture.md match the implemented contract. Rule on whether the two filters I did not test -- ineffective supersessions and retired supersessions absent as causes, and reviewedPaths excluding an at-or-before-verdict basis -- require tests before approval. Record Architecture, Security and Simplification. File approved or changes-requested with gs review naming all six artifacts. Any head change invalidates review.","to":"5f12e916d136b0c1ed941aa99f4c47af94021451e31d08159d8df368e9946123"}}